# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# This matters more here than in a normal project: a registry item embeds its
# source file verbatim as a `content` string in the published JSON. A block
# saved with CRLF on Windows ships CRLF to every adopter on every platform,
# and the diff noise makes PRs unreviewable in the meantime.
#
# After adding this file, run once:
#   git add --renormalize .
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
